int search(int[] a, int k) {
    int lo = 0, hi = a.length - 1;
    while (lo <= hi) {
        int mid = lo + (hi - lo) / 2;
        if (a[mid] == k) return mid;
        if (a[mid] < k) lo = mid + 1; else hi = mid - 1;
    }
    return -1;
}
```

